    <dcterms:title>Support Organization Ontology</dcterms:title>
    <dcterms:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-10-16</dcterms:modified>
    <rdfs:comment>Machine-readable model of the support organization: the concepts, relationships, rules and vocabulary AI agents may use when reasoning about accounts, tickets, documentation and escalations. Generated from the markdown source of truth in Ontology/.</rdfs:comment>
